WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.368
Can RNA polymerase start anywhere on a

00:00:02.414 --> 00:00:02.785
gene?

00:00:03.412 --> 00:00:04.306
Let's try the middle.

00:00:04.457 --> 00:00:05.293
Nothing happens.

00:00:05.479 --> 00:00:07.673
Transcription can't begin at a random spot.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:09.403
Now try the promoter.

00:00:09.647 --> 00:00:11.505
Polymerase makes first contact here.

00:00:12.131 --> 00:00:13.583
Proteins open the helix.

00:00:14.303 --> 00:00:15.963
Now it can read the template strand.

00:00:16.683 --> 00:00:18.041
The promoter is the start line.

00:00:18.192 --> 00:00:19.562
Now try the question again.
